        "name": "zizmor Pages v0.3.0",
        "description": "Seeds /zizmor (about, findings, coverage, runs) and /zizmor/finding — one finding in full, reached from any audit cell on the findings table. See req-zizmor-page-landing and req-zizmor-page-finding. v0.3.0 (zizmor-tap#31): the findings table's badges actually render — tone maps for severity and confidence (Low only), datetime formatters on both timestamps, the stray column-level capitalize gone; /zizmor/finding leaves the navigation (it needs ?finding_id=); the finding-detail panel gains workflow_page_template, /github_core/workflow?workflow_id={workflow_id}, the key that page takes since tap-plugin-github-core#101. Panel and page node upserts; every id stable, batch id moved."
      },
